      "special_list": {
        "0": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "details": "<ul><li><p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: Signika, sans-serif\"><a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-link=\"\" data-uuid=\"JournalEntry.FbwTycwFuAdCfXi7\" data-id=\"FbwTycwFuAdCfXi7\" data-type=\"JournalEntry\" data-tooltip=\"Journal Entry\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; user-select: text; scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(93, 20, 43) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); cursor: pointer; --content-link-background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); background-image: none !important; background-position: initial !important; background-size: initial !important; background-repeat: initial !important; background-attachment: initial !important; background-origin: initial !important; background-clip: initial !important; background-color: rgb(102, 102, 102); padding: 0px !important; border: none !important; border-radius: 2px; white-space: nowrap; word-break: break-all; color: rgb(25, 24, 19); font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; position: relative; top: 2px; font-family: Signika, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Innate</span></strong></a></span></span></p></li></ul><p>At the start of each <strong>round</strong>, <strong>Ozmo</strong> shuffles its <strong>elemental affinity</strong>, randomly changing its <strong>strengths</strong> and <strong>weaknesses</strong>.</p><p>Also, <strong>Ozmo </strong>may removes 1 <strong>debuff</strong> from itself <strong>at the end of its turn</strong>.</p>",
          "icon": "",
          "macro_name": "Elemental Shift",
          "roll": "",
          "special_name": "📜Elemental Shift"
        },
        "1": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "details": "<p>At the start of every round, deals 5 <strong>Air</strong> damage to all enemy.</p>\n<hr>\n<details>\n    <summary><strong>📜 Gathering Storm</strong></summary>\n    <p><strong>Air </strong>damage dealt by ⭐️ <strong>Ozmo </strong>inflicts <strong>Sheer Cold </strong>equal to <strong>【1 x The number of Current Round】</strong></p>\n    <p><strong>Ice </strong>damage dealt by ⭐️ <strong>Ozmo </strong>do not remove <strong>Sheer Cold </strong>stack from the target when inflicting <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: Signika, sans-serif\"><a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-link=\"\" data-uuid=\"JournalEntry.p0XupN5rieyjMNaI\" data-id=\"p0XupN5rieyjMNaI\" data-type=\"JournalEntry\" data-tooltip=\"Journal Entry\" aria-describedby=\"tooltip\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; user-select: text; scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(93, 20, 43) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); cursor: pointer; --content-link-background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); background-image: none !important; background-position: initial !important; background-size: initial !important; background-repeat: initial !important; background-attachment: initial !important; background-origin: initial !important; background-clip: initial !important; background-color: rgb(102, 102, 102); padding: 0px !important; border: none !important; border-radius: 2px; white-space: nowrap; word-break: break-all; color: rgb(25, 24, 19); font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; position: relative; top: 2px; font-family: Signika, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Frozen</span></strong></a></span></span></p>\n</details>",
